{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10009_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a9ccb675c531f47db4c9adbf4afd6148c60f75efc998167350f55c3cee338648",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d0c6f981ee55532a46ac7225722abc778220325d7e71b29ac683e83b9f64ca2",
      "text": "迈向全新挑战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:915c421723c9a5fd24c5e52604facb1d77d9786637085ddd9b100f2337eda1ad",
      "text": "与兜家有交情的和服店，向F-LAGS发来了\n担任新设礼服品牌形象代言人的邀约。\n三人对CM拍摄干劲十足。制作人提议\n大家进行一次集训……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d0c6f981ee55532a46ac7225722abc778220325d7e71b29ac683e83b9f64ca2",
      "text": "迈向全新挑战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58309324ba003ba18d1289b21a4010e8d3bff583645492d5403b69ff49789b74",
      "text": "练习之后的饭就是香啊！差不多该点甜点\n了吧。选这个芭菲吧。你们两个打算吃啥？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d917b1e563282ad14514f02a169b5131dd2831f5d8d37348a18f9b1763838a34",
      "text": "……啊，我也吃。蛋糕、馅蜜，还有\n季节限定的焦糖布丁……选哪个好真纠结啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04dae0d19bc0ab8e8a3995e1da6034e9a0b1118f92801ec8da83917b8b0529a2",
      "text": "我选这个！\n看菜单的时候就很在意了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a7b6521dc487674d24b11edf9c5d20f3cbcb54b552c4fe16e368983584b42b",
      "text": "……六代目。打扰您用餐十分抱歉。\n有一件事需要立刻向您汇报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b225e6829697a239f405b65d9269d263acfd43efd20026465399527c72713b",
      "text": "（既然这么急，\n看来是蛮严肃的事啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9",
      "text": "知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37c2b5a957bcee79921293bcf181177b63dd466b930161e96055e1aaed01a427",
      "text": "凉、老师。俺稍微离席一下。\n帮俺点个甜点等俺回来哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8d7b18ffc08fcc78863d4aaf54427fcda6927098025db7e9c33cea41c6c8e88",
      "text": "请等一下。如果可以的话，\n这件事情希望也能让另外两位一同听听。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84171591acfd619ad910aa057641bc9d5537d035890aaba35e47cb5d6a839a04",
      "text": "……连我们也要？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4de81d41c0e815c7ee86f775ce70fd41a668463f4992e392bdb4aebd57d2a11e",
      "text": "（凉和老师也要听吗。……不能跟正经人\n说的事，这帮家伙应该也不会说的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b2fe8ff6baf195f435c47111b726d5fc1fac2eea05e11ae743ed0c20c86857",
      "text": "你们俩也听到了。不好意思能一起\n听听不？哎呀，绝不会亏待你们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203c7b003352560294e72c1be5185fa522d45bd5f2e35b0fc55f6ebf3d4e8984",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n其实，方才……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7f4865651c21f2099bbd445f267533e90d33e6da690fc56ba6374e068f877c",
      "text": "……原来如此啊，居然有这回事。\n你们俩觉得咋样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0386e32a4a9bbd1c57355f1a944cc85c304edb87342166775457a4ea5b5c16b",
      "text": "当然OK啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_a:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc5825a7cff7595207f00ca706279aa7895ba77f1cecf31dca7a161faf73de94",
      "text": "……啊，我也是。\n现在就去跟制作人说吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c840c30b201813703883946feafefaeb10b1af82c1e91d0f0a7f5cdd23d96945",
      "text": "315 Production·事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e0776ea960a0aee15d1aec7346d7eaa26a42ad24ca3b6f943e96766809fee10",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●●●●●●●Boss！\n俺有事商量。能告诉俺啥时候有空不？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702afe74913ec31a6fe6fe97ee8e178421e1741f0dfea3f12e63b8e08f8900ce",
      "text": "现在就可以哦。\n想商量什么事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c1b9db79dde2bf4c5c55dac3c68c2959743fef3d46605a8266bc26b317a8449",
      "text": "谢啦，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7a53cb74efec784f11bd5bd9b1f802f1453ea93890e63b924546601e034220f",
      "text": "兜家一直以来承蒙关照的老字号和服店，\n找俺商量说想请F-LAGS接个活儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1e136293b7c621011b9eb1e901dda7f9cce20293b649e3c4c28f1b27dad6442",
      "text": "好像是作为全新尝试，成立了一个礼服品牌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13f41851ecac2eade3d396af4de0c2eb4c7af37d32cd0f58d1ecc3ef9ae1c5e5",
      "text": "说是无论如何都想拜托咱们F-LAGS\n来做形象代言人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd11bc10a05db6704f68e971c6ab85e5c3a4ba77b2d89acd7417ab380c8da2f",
      "text": "原来如此，我明白了！\n我先联络对方询问一下详细情况。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:558b81a95e2809685fb44dd126aa67976b9b982bc55e266dd822d69ef8827923",
      "text": "喔，谢啦，Boss！\n那这就是联络方式！拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0776a4c28a81b9af4554ecbba54742cc71071f586ad261c22f3786781e590f29",
      "text": "谢谢。那我这就联络对方。\n大家请在休息室稍等片刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcf370afb0c20a157e819d793798b8f575025954920db0bc7d9fa33fd25d300e",
      "text": "你们俩也痛快接下了，谢啦！\n让俺再道一次谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdba001d8e5f3202a2cdfa6eda9911d80e05fcacd3dd427562c25ab0eff1c45a",
      "text": "哇哇，不用这样啦……！\n快把头抬起来，大吾君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f8eed9a9810dcfdf16efd712fe7d5696a2412639a0e73966d267888ea42ca40",
      "text": "……这又不是别人的事，是大吾拜托的。\n怎么可能会拒绝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51df3e18a4797bdb339346dcd0d69c6d86f200e3b79b141ed729dbc765074308",
      "text": "就是呀！看制作人刚才的反应，\n肯定会接下来的。等等答复吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000125:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64856f976eee20a06b48e0d7e7b8fc1c0f4a6af5c6a80d3dd257082750045806",
      "text": "喂喂，是俺啊，Boss！\n突然打电话过来，不好意思哈～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000135:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28db3e39e9bbb6920505b4cde5e227e6e535767dc735c7b4feb7f771d76aed3c",
      "text": "白天那事，俺想再道个谢。\n新品牌的工作，谢谢你接下啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000137:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59468b5b86941b714230483a9c256fca7b35407218b1b0ffc960c9ac5662792c",
      "text": "这都是托大吾先生\n人脉福分的工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000138:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:671e4c66b55a29c7ebf97a3b3d30ad5021b347236b65c68a0727ae1ae2e344fe",
      "text": "这次的事情，\n也是因为有缘分在呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6546ca17c7e919bb84df68028272c61a2761ab862bf93c606fc1ac55c69e4360",
      "text": "把这份缘分紧紧系好的，\n可是●●●●●●●●●●Boss你啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f7d6ed78ec1f8a3e5522783621e83e56823fe2e30d49fe05e36be0f6e69284d",
      "text": "而且，速度快得超乎俺的预料，说实话惊到俺了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:190434c7f06740ee49eff82ad9f7010a0b5cc00d107d50bf5999a8d4fc27988c",
      "text": "和服店的熟人也很吃惊呢！\n更重要的是，再三向Boss表示了感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000147:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2ef7b2e153724ed23bd7c42758ca0e0aa5864a4d80c8ff6f6d08e63161cf1c2",
      "text": "俺的心情也一样。\n真的谢谢你啊，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4052cf530fc952db484a7c6c19141fdf9166f0b67b5b3f45b99ab0e9d74f0e4",
      "text": "这份恩情俺绝对不忘。一定会报答的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0987611f8278c22ef9aa1fb448479c7e5dcc2bba4a10ac5455300f712536184",
      "text": "……那么。请让这项工作\n圆满成功吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5976c5f84cacaec45805e48afe30f636705baf6ec43673d1e4381c3a67d047a4",
      "text": "哇哈哈！说得对！\n俺绝对会让它大获成功。约好啦，Boss！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_b:cmd-000156:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4dfe79017100ee6e24bfed2489f93f37e54d60145d82ac58c48b911d895aa96",
      "text": "那俺就为了明天的练习，\n差不多该睡了。回见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6449fd5c7d6c10998b7fb47fc3315e5acc3194377c03c56827bc4b4b97c66980",
      "text": "让各位久等了。那支CM的\n合作歌曲Demo和歌词送到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51142cfe3f11f0d701621b02ca0ee8caa847ce384dc1fff69e37a5af7d4e35f5",
      "text": "谢谢！\n大吾君、一希先生，我们快听听看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000054:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:beb7790c3e027f79bea3bf8aa30a4ce68d67418a889479946d8eeb57211100d7",
      "text": "这就是咱们的新歌……对于全新创立的\n礼服品牌来说，真是再合适不过的曲子了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1076240c8bcf3237c7b0dac846e5597188c28e2f3b2bddf1577c7d0ba1ac79df",
      "text": "歌词也很棒呢。同样的“♪”，\n有时念作“Love”，有时又念作“Happy”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e408d9e48b171577ad0c3e9afb9364a232df46e092e6cd75c7468387aa8a87d3",
      "text": "……啊，挺有趣的歌词。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd67cd4acdd9c6ee52188f17af0aca810d0a540e81fb5f0fda6ef144019b5d77",
      "text": "嗯！\n真想早点和大家一起演唱这首歌啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b76aa51e518fe685d3eb131563bbb46de6945ec846294f405cc20cae3819ab4",
      "text": "（F-LAGS是为了实现梦想、改变自己而迈出崭新一步的三人组合……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:463ff43c5c0d1ce88bda967eb9584ded5eca254a15bb0f6a78df480147ae34e5",
      "text": "（和勇于挑战新事物的客户契合度真是完美极了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d66d521bc98e024fdc24ea282d6e73f15ac7eb9b344c14103d17be6753e8219a",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，\n到拍摄CM为止的日程表已经排好了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20e39bd672a31eb7e0ec043672da92edb6c467aaef95f2a6c682f6de8af3733d",
      "text": "已经排好了！都整理在这里了，请看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8d279d95fea2b4c6aacb629fdfc06557c1ff0b6ba2dcab5c29af7f6ac41670b",
      "text": "谢啦，Boss！\n让俺瞧瞧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53cc0867f2ffbf1d3164a037b46eddce12bcfab2d45351c18563f7705fadbf66",
      "text": "声乐课，还有录音、\n新歌的舞蹈排练……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55b1543a31392c1334b2af80211f1e46618a4e4610ee9f88d6f7547962406f88",
      "text": "哇哈哈。早有心理准备，但还真是排得满满当当啊！\n好！俺这次要集中攻克不擅长的唱歌～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52a6730262388ce450e5fb70884d7f0617a7e8e7fd386b70fa7112a88163c085",
      "text": "那么，我就练习帅气的站姿吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9cefc172da1c76925a5cecde3ff96bd33a225086c17dc4b4330d1923588bc13",
      "text": "毕竟无意识中，有时还是会露出以前当女偶像时的习惯呢。\n必须时刻注意才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca0ff12145d390f1588e6ec18a5ba04126170ec1de9007d25f019be27691174",
      "text": "……虽然我的目标比较抽象，\n但我会努力尽量展现出属于自己的风格。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebc656bf1892218075e5350a014558a2184991fde83fb21c4c2864e52f2c36da",
      "text": "如果想要克服弱点的话，\n大家一起进行集中集训如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fd91cb4b66504d1526ea9549ff1cf4c7b35acef1c8d51c43d52a6ed4a4aa406",
      "text": "……感觉那样能收获良多啊。\n我想参加。凉和大吾觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c60213418ce285291fba85d8a6295fd6955ca28071aa9bde11f129a44d23a0a0",
      "text": "太棒了！集训的话，\n在男生宿舍进行怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88aff05067ccb7bf3ef233ffd1b6f6293d1762d6bba59bac62db588446ed2203",
      "text": "赞成！\n感觉会是场不错的训练呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2845736f6f0fb4adbb5afc3d410d049ed87f3db0234bc1c10ab1dc58c2d3b4f0",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，\n能拜托你安排一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_d:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81665d9e7997a5ba9665f5fa767a76334be3f9ff80c102767ee7716188359d49",
      "text": "嗯，当然可以！\n那我们就来定一下日期吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5adb9a0ddfca6ee5b1455bad59dff482f7be12d4422e768c969ab8a3e206c9af",
      "text": "集训第一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a3c8ca5fc719e4ded3e288c895af0298b9b0b6957bc80a95afe252ebaec7e48",
      "text": "（集训进展得很顺利！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b958bfba30882f01cd3dfdc02b6162eee12943595dede9ed15a4612cfa06309",
      "text": "大吾君，我有感觉到你在唱歌时，\n很留心指导老师叮嘱的事情哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8acc389eb661901663a7bddfeaa6fe7194b4dc9a618941bd78548e0220371a6b",
      "text": "一希先生独唱的部分，\n也很有画面感，非常精彩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2852bd52fe241e6ea3b56df501f00cb2437556a8b51393e05a65f2166e38c0db",
      "text": "噢！凉这么说俺真高兴！\n想抓住这股感觉。能再来一次不？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f161e2cdc81be94ee21f272bc456ed6febc1235e0d908fb89f9565aca36457",
      "text": "……啊。来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:514a951a57d3bed7e315efa717f6efdce47cfab33571f159cf24afd8605130e1",
      "text": "那么，再从头唱一遍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a2babe49a2a5432615a2b34385242fe03936403a3f3a33350229a5837165381",
      "text": "凉下巴稍微\n收进去一点可能会更好看哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f92dc5736f785679ec9c402ed5c69ecc9403f59b3c5ec89465967e47cbd65e57",
      "text": "老师反倒试着把头抬起来一点好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7739e79e1b4a3c013a18e24c2f3ce6f6c6301765ef0aa5d13f3d4bc5202dd5c1",
      "text": "……像这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f06be5e779121bbfadf93906ba9b01fd5e8a7c8af92cf3dcae35f1bb51d568",
      "text": "……怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0156a302b3d4ab96853098d0e7b8ca030d24192ad7dc35bd9b1e13d5c1696759",
      "text": "俺觉得你们俩都很棒！\n拍张照片发给你们。自己也确认一下看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_e:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1519d50b671e0e869d7e6d0a71aef4afeea8651788eb275ec03972642085f57",
      "text": "大家辛苦了！\n差不多该休息一下了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1663413f80c0235443256072892d132841a821c3bb3341fa1fe8bbeea7d83478",
      "text": "老师，俺把饮料和凉的饼干拿来咯。\n……嗯？在写啥呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6c5733a48331a1a70773dd9c7a1eae9d021c2a27a74cd818f51cc723e8bd28d",
      "text": "今天用的不是便签本呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14bc1b2f9776cd790165129b0f972106a3f16cddc1483c9377f4373f6b10e618",
      "text": "……啊。这是今天F-LAGS的练习笔记。\n想着等会儿也让你们俩确认一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a23f4de83381e0814045d242ecebc361fb727a1d197859e7a1a34c03dde639",
      "text": "……正好。\n凉、大吾……能看看这个吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34162f0fa2e87f57fefa06237bdc53d7a171faf1f5075036d35236732f258202",
      "text": "……这是我提的建议呢。这边是\n大吾君的。……非常通俗易懂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33cfb99de8823a46ee1669244d15eccc4d7ad28cda9270fe5bb05f3dbb7e05fa",
      "text": "而且很清楚。复盘的时候肯定超顶用！\n这事情只有老师能做得到啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:954eb5a3c275b8f15ad6a449632f88a4acdf2704e71aaac610b8ec568cd62398",
      "text": "……那样就太好了。如果有想回顾的内容，\n随时跟我说。笔记借你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6e7d10afae7b857bb96b4b63bc0da9019617d0892d363ebbff277c67a4e5010",
      "text": "谢谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bda1e58247a46048e40276541ca5f43bec19da34893ae629ad04710a179ccac5",
      "text": "……咦，这个？第一页是空白的呢。\n这里是目录页吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34c273bddab24bd4b0c4b9a670d5ae849ba6e21edb641d4134615921b4920e8f",
      "text": "……这里我打算写上这次的干劲与决心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2480dc0596078ef7c0ae4e1897a65e92d07a106c1c23a669cd2de2d4a80020c9",
      "text": "……也能拜托凉和大吾写一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c524d4eee6677719eb4a25eec6384e31152fabbc2e540f9741fb3f14c2deff2",
      "text": "当然好啊！凉，你先写好吗？\n这种事果然还是得队长先来嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2833dfc64cc705ff9523c0fab16e43675e47b71dc5090625806833edc3aba980",
      "text": "好的。那就……\n“加油干！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2c194f875fbb7172b7e7fa8dd83c3f95f5b27eeebcee5a0e7d93c10e747643e",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，字是不是写得有点太大了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e2ea3535d2607e75994115b3cf01ceb8d0cfc845c5272a8cd75f8f8e9356577",
      "text": "……很有凉的风格，挺好的。\n接下来大吾，拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:747c222c209c6236225341fba36d0a160cd601eaac2982fb20734210ff42eb8f",
      "text": "和凉还有老师一起“加油！”搞定！\n写好啦，老师。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce3c191f8523ffe51043b261f6b019cfd0a412816584e34e5b8d09a0c69c02db",
      "text": "……谢谢。我也写了“全力以赴”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74137e90b09d130a8f9e4edaa3d94cd41f0b88eb7a0c4968e2d97334c8b1c665",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n最后能请你也写一句话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fc4d0c11bff1c74cc55f685cdab46d27dcd1c46fc77ed5463105e676c63668f",
      "text": "好的！那么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000118:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c96611d839d93538d32a00a03cc682facc34950b9552f85bedf03970796cf7",
      "text": "为大家加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_g:cmd-000118:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7e2d4b40b63f98e9fc566d7b5145da923c16c638a22c9f1885bf030e4dc72a",
      "text": "appeal",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac08573febdbd905e8eaaa89660c461b15034c891aae9fb5d9a49c4ac858c41",
      "text": "男生宿舍·食堂",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f68bd36343378badd7ea38706a47534d48eb79f2ea3e9207b26ba5096a060ac",
      "text": "哇，能切出这么长的萝卜薄片，\n太厉害了，大吾君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb14a0e7a707f82d370cea12a85bdad5b527d398012df4b42bab19564feebbef",
      "text": "哇哈哈。俺还能削得更长呢。\n做味噌汤和沙拉就包在俺身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7317654d7b43d59ebaf4d623b79e9647fe61c6e4ce9bdf6e333666283e0603fa",
      "text": "嗯。好——，我也得赶紧处理\n作为主菜的肉类料理了。先焯水预处理一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c94cee242e9c296e03184ab3dbbdb3029eefa412671d32eb14a31378113ccd75",
      "text": "（……凉既然以做饭为爱好，手脚确实麻利啊。\n大吾用起菜刀来也很熟练）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acdf27bf66bdc02d43e3f2c91e9cad21f50b2835749a8ee4bc11cf37c057b8a1",
      "text": "……好。米淘完了。\n接下来只要泡在水里就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be7d649f851d86d67c535c3c52addb397d066a095c5fc00155c2d6fd13a8c8b3",
      "text": "一希先生用砂锅焖的米饭，我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11f4f33d97886255462e7427cf0720b49f962ed24247735785e1408dad3d1f9",
      "text": "……嗯。在露营中积累的经验\n能派上用场真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36534829f044b8f81d2787d481bd008aacf473f0ab4c5813806ce40987b2c179",
      "text": "老师的爱好是露营真是太好啦！\n是吧，凉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0e4e02b3dbd31341a29887fda8df930df6e57d10427a5955634a65d7fbe39f2",
      "text": "嗯！对了，等准备完了，\n大家要不要一起去宿舍附近的养生水疗馆？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e556580c1afa9bcf445c7fda80852692ea442aaabb1bda8427917b00ece83ea2",
      "text": "……大家一起泡澡吗。很有集训的感觉，挺好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9edf4405c29b3d942cbab3a84aa73669f7b5d0c299aee41ae1e81e308ba71284",
      "text": "哇哈哈，确实是呢。那咱就继续准备吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000131:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:648d8692056c568a9f2a4e714453c3de7b7ab7a77dad01eca0d4b465636c04d8",
      "text": "制作人，\n您按计划出发\n离开事务所了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000133:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d41eeba6eda4947966068b6dd564020040fcc64e8e7125f723e9bda6412fca",
      "text": "正在往那边赶！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000133:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ecf49fd3c7692eb2af37eca85fef64950e69b994b938d4619d173f2144f147a",
      "text": "我现在正往\n男生宿舍赶过去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:022353acb1360ced23d70b8134d0fbf202f244075021aadebe3538fce73a551a",
      "text": "太好了。饭焖好的\n时候差不多能到吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7567e0ba2a5c9695f39b90155bdefc9666b12fc429d33d3b7e75f8efd68b719c",
      "text": "Boss，你听俺说！\n老师控火绝了！\n真想让Boss也瞧瞧<emoji>image_talk_emoji_12</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000140:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6a470641de7667309d0e8d6c5bc6363029d7feddb2fdb664db0ea32eba40ba7",
      "text": "听起来好令人好奇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000140:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da05170688722475d957e88f1d3ead4c9e5f183164ff8e91cf6be48981992b8f",
      "text": "有那么厉害吗？\n真让人好奇！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000141:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e28c6d630b1eb47d7be5c5b7cf36a468b0d0dcc6cbf39e3fa33ee6c21f6a4966",
      "text": "真不愧是\n一希先生呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000141:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9382e99b984d4068d8c7ecc88486584bdc6aad40db3995d349e51f9b584ff9c7",
      "text": "真不愧是一希先生呢！\n好想亲眼看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000145:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:513893e1a9cbfdbdd703d578c84bb82ce28404dba3d9b60084242467857c34b9",
      "text": "当时要是录个视频\n就好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000147:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25dd621e537e59b990b28377a4fe0fd6400f97cd3ce635b901caafba6d9d3aae",
      "text": "摇曳的火光确实\n让人百看不厌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000149:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa5378a234486031e419ecf8a7a815d6c36d6b60765112d9d9925fb8c43c3a7b",
      "text": "不过要是拍视频，\n用篝火焖饭\n更有画面感吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000151:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98149235d6e325dec208191e703106887e87c2ce9ae8029aa6e7f9c822ed756f",
      "text": "换成老师的话哪种\n都很有画面感啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000153:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:095389c3b7ff6c25200ead76ec7f49903ed262ac1d3eca175c34fc44ee4c8041",
      "text": "嗯！拍了的话真想发到\n315 Pro的官方频道上呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000155:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af01f3483006f8220aa700224231fb653a57ce7d6a37861bcf0f87f5d20efcec",
      "text": "要发视频的话，\n3个人一起做露营野餐饭\n咋样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000157:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc5ee206c750c26405ab8405c01a16bdd53c3ea8925d94a30183b8fa64adee4",
      "text": "好主意！刚才一希先生\n提到的野炊料理，我也正想\n试着做做看呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000159:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:778689d16c77b6bc39d9ad83a8d8441235e934e375df775fc905343590db69ed",
      "text": "赞成。需要的道具\n我来准备。交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000161:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f231796b926f0e91274fd52fb679ce7827d4a75baa88019f02a9fbab3b6e53",
      "text": "就是这么回事啦，Boss。\n边吃晚饭边跟您\n聊聊这事呗<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_h:cmd-000163:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4decb0640422e1c9e2d34616d6b6e79fc2971fc03a405f5abb055cb607409278",
      "text": "大家都在等您。\n路上小心哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38040434ab6fa83997d286865250c6d1c9374b1c04a0228b1aa745b2e0010295",
      "text": "男生宿舍·单间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5481f4a4a6e825068ec379e91e27d02730170fcc77fdf32cb88e93d11e2b2a1",
      "text": "那么，开始今天的练习总结会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d8e4539e550ac84e0ba71b230fc6fed5818429cfbf07c24ff436eac3ca955eb",
      "text": "老师写的练习笔记该派上用场啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e7ecc9f3d00b559f1c237fe4e078d2042766a6fc8e11809163eb612418cf496",
      "text": "……在那之后我又补充了一些地方。\n要是有不足之处就告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e71bc4611b05bc19b77a08e187c5f1555e79060c4899c572913f376f97234453",
      "text": "好的！非常感谢！\n首先从各自在意的地方开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ca2b61d1f074f3669c45775fec1b5883cff6c08ef7fb9a802fb8b5529c23306",
      "text": "……能从我先开始吗。是关于最后\n歌舞过了一遍的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae0e81995f9bf714bdd0765e7680132536125917ec4aaca5cfd101390725f865",
      "text": "（咦？没人应门……是去大吾先生或者一希先生的\n房间了吗？门没锁呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fda619f67fb87b542f790fc47ada8eb534b7a17fe65bb05e597ee68f3647d0",
      "text": "凉先生，在吗？我开门咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a848491496effd0545758b079d8fd25a72bdc7fd2dbff9673b3f2dcfdb8ef8bb",
      "text": "……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36585b7b8d278648ea0818bc8303aedfc905056a52a622eaab7d0e68d77db6d1",
      "text": "（大吾先生和一希先生也在。……大家都围着\n笔记睡着了。应该是聊着聊着就困了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7d8539c35490372be624078070a652eb0af7a615dd38279436de20325873518",
      "text": "（为了不着凉，帮他们盖上被子……好了。\n大家，今天辛苦了。晚安）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10f1249e31736768c6f28012395038244604c1b0c281343a3af4a592b2fc7c14",
      "text": "CM试映会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7360535414970f4362c3e20f53cd0cc22cf503b02c53e26d13cfbd7dcd0395d0",
      "text": "……试映会马上就要开始了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9dab09c321fa9b556280d56661b3bc948941bc2370de7fee174ff8ad91d889a",
      "text": "会剪辑成什么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac66809f431b734a9794488d729ed58460c78574565a0e3f3ca2b3268de17b2",
      "text": "距离拍摄那天过了挺久啦。\n好期待看到成品影像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3bef55ab3aebcb9f91f8cff096935602a9ac3c79b55cc81b0535ff8cc9728c",
      "text": "各位，人好像都到齐了。要开始了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48f94e444197c736fe25a15f4c801e475d9685d854ee0e183848bbe88483892c",
      "text": "效果太棒了！\n完全配得上作为新品牌起步的CM！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15a48f2d0552fc03c65c859d32f2166c0108d45fe7638002b99575c14ea3eaec",
      "text": "制作人、F-LAGS的各位。这次真的\n非常感谢大家能接受我们的邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000205:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7edb821e9ddb8681aaa9de4f4e588e51bcb8e10b819c099ba1a741ebe6b057d",
      "text": "遇到困难互相帮衬嘛。以后要是还有事，\n再联络●●●●●●●●●●Boss哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_j:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68eabaf2d2dfec75b78efc64d6181388d19963bc7771171adfd9b44a83cf253b",
      "text": "肯定会像这次一样听你们倾诉的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef2804dc4c8c76d96fff049978bf43b306575714b18f15c3a2053682c9a15cc",
      "text": "一个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb4f85a2b3ae865334d3a1000a016944abb2a6c64d9c3d5443918ad1fe1a4be8",
      "text": "九十九家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e0c76162a317c3d4d4a9db514b340a5ff8a1be70671816e0bf4b6dce54ee52",
      "text": "回来啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9b150d179374938301946824926187d621ddf5fe8cff53fe891d6f8d227342d",
      "text": "……\n……啊，我回来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7520fc7379aaf1b8b944f0931b4e9949aeacec0bc5d99a70ee311759f83e07",
      "text": "（……在书房以外的地方见到父亲，\n有多久没遇到了呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33512dd5ccc6fda2d95049b7b727d0d120fa8c40f62e3490d47e69078bc0ceae",
      "text": "看了CM。\n……你变了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77cdbbb7ef60f7e7f8a4d97c4193c94f359dcd56eacb991c329f45bf34f05b45",
      "text": "……父亲也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cd3656ee67aeadca05678e3241b1d24282323641deab2dbfa41847b0b138936",
      "text": "（……父亲注意到了我在改变，\n并像这样传达给了我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:910976bee4193f217b177c300d5791c4d8988d1a0c162570cdff68619be97c02",
      "text": "（……好高兴。虽然现在还只是微小的变化）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ae964d9055c65bbcd33111bfa1ad1b4bfb9bb02c672858c6638328e7bdd9a5c",
      "text": "（……我知道了，只要我改变，\n父亲也同样会随之改变）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10009_01:1_3_10009_01_k:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31ceec36553a7a5bfebe644e7c233ed48bd9cf471635fb31092c179e276e7f40",
      "text": "（……今后4个人也要一起努力下去。\n就像在那本笔记上写下的那样）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
